                      (    constants.asm):00207         
                      (    constants.asm):00208         * 6309 opcodes.
     008E             (    constants.asm):00209         LDXOPC  equ     $8E             LDX (immediate)
     007E             (    constants.asm):00210         JMPOPC  equ     $7E             JMP (extended)
