     0039             (    constants.asm):00212         RTSOPC  equ     $39             RTS (inherent)
     2503             (    constants.asm):00213         BCSOPC  equ     $2503           BCS *+5 (relative)
     2603             (    constants.asm):00214         BNEOPC  equ     $2603           BNE *+5 (relative)
