                      (        forth.asm):03525         * Double (numerator high/low) gets divided by a single cell number. Please note
                      (        forth.asm):03526         * that this is a strictly unsigned business. Input parameters are supposed to
                      (        forth.asm):03527         * have been set up by the caller on the system stack. The quotient (high/low)
