                      (        forth.asm):03984         * a 32 bit result. A simpler description of algorithm M can be found in
                      (        forth.asm):03985         * Henry S. Warren Junior's "Hacker's Delight", second edition, section 8-1,
                      (        forth.asm):03986         * pp 171. A C prototype implementation for a little endian host is provided
                      (        forth.asm):03987         * in SW/util/umstar.c.
                      (        forth.asm):03988         * In essence we reduce the problem to a 2 digit by 2 digit (expressed in
                      (        forth.asm):03989         * base 256) multiplication and use the 6809 MUL (A * B -> D) instruction.
